          "methods": "<p>Data was collected from observations of acorn woodpecker social groups and territory sites in the field across four years.  Behavioral data for each social group/territory site was obtained from at least three thirty-minute observational periods per year occurring every two weeks during the spring reproductive season.  Urban imperviousness  data was obtained from Dewitz and U.S. Geological Survey 2021 (<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KZCM54\">https://doi.org/10.5066/P9KZCM54)</a>.  Anthropogenic light was obtained from Elvidge et al. 2017 (<a href=\"http://dx.doi.org/10.1080/01431161.2017.1342050\">http://dx.doi.org/10.1080/01431161.2017.1342050</a>).</p>\n",
